3, 691], "label": "combined_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "combined_audio"}], "size": [1017.0795288085938, 879], "pos": [-7066.5048828125, 1261.672119140625], "widgets_values": ["## GLOBAL STYLE\n\n**Visual Style:** \nAmerican TV Comedy style, high contrast, vibrant colors, neon CBD urban vibe.\n\n**Lighting Style:** \nCommercial-grade night lighting. Background filled with neon bokeh. Rim lighting on subjects to highlight the silk texture of the cheongsams.\n\n**Camera Language:** \nRhythmic fast cutting, including \"fourth wall\" breaks and dynamic action tracking.\n\n**Emotion Rhythm:** \nAccusation -> Provocation -> Serious Appeal -> Carnival -> Explosion.\n\n**Pacing:** \nFast-paced dialogue for the first 15s, explosive action for the last 15s. Total 30s.\n\n**Cinematic Tone:** \nAbsurdist realism, visually gorgeous but physically gritty.\n", 360, 15.000000000000004, "{\"segments\":[{\"id\":\"1779821528084k13jc\",\"start\":0,\"length\":71,\"prompt\":\"**Shot Type:** Medium Shot\\n**Camera Motion:** Fixed to slight zoom in\\n**Scene Description:** Busy CBD square at night. A man in a vintage floral short cheongsam with a silver clutch points forward sternly.\\n**Character Action:** The man points accusingly at the woman off-camera.\\n**Facial Expression:** Angry, incredulous.\\n**Product Interaction:** Slim-fit cheongsam showcasing masculine muscle lines vs. feminine attire.\\n**Lighting:** Warm ambient light highlighting the gold stitching.\\n**Dialogue:** “你是不是把我旗袍给改成你的旗袍了？！”\\n**Transition:** Cut to next shot\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"13e65c0dc4441a889a39a69572c728e5c4378caa8f5166b9658230c234fa5e1b.png\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=13e65c0dc4441a889a39a69572c728e5c4378caa8f5166b9658230c234fa5e1b.png&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJhMjhkMzRkNmE5OGNkYmI4MjVhYmRiMzRhYjhmMzNhMSIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA0MjYyNDE4MTAsInRzIjoxNzc5ODIxNDQxODEwLCJzaWduIjoiM2ZmZjM2MDZkYzhlYTY3ZWU4NDQ3NTkxNmZlMmE2Y2MifQ==&Rh-Identify=a28d34d6a98cdbb825abdb34ab8f33a1\"},{\"id\":\"17798216701216mm5q\",\"start\":71,\"length\":73,\"prompt\":\"**Shot Type:** Medium Shot\\n**Camera Motion:** Static\\n**Scene Description:** A woman in a dark green patterned cheongsam with braided hair stands in the same CBD background.\\n**Character Action:** She stands elegantly but with a defiant gaze.\\n**Facial Expression:** Sassy, confident, slightly mocking.\\n**Product Interaction:** The cheongsam fits perfectly, showing the sheen of green silk.\\n**Lighting:** Neon cool-toned background contrasting her skin tone.\\n**Dialogue:** “我穿上比你穿上好看。”\\n**Transition:** Cut to next shot\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"01dd1cad685bb5fc7edf7875264dea9aac46287a3196d7ebc302f67d0e095238.png\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=01dd1cad685bb5fc7edf7875264dea9aac46287a3196d7ebc302f67d0e095238.png&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJhMjhkMzRkNmE5OGNkYmI4MjVhYmRiMzRhYjhmMzNhMSIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA0MjYyNDE4MTAsInRzIjoxNzc5ODIxNDQxODEwLCJzaWduIjoiM2ZmZjM2MDZkYzhlYTY3ZWU4NDQ3NTkxNmZlMmE2Y2MifQ==&Rh-Identify=a28d34d6a98cdbb825abdb34ab8f33a1\"},{\"id\":\"1779821696953q8vby\",\"start\":144,\"length\":73,\"prompt\":\"**Shot Type:** Two-shot (Medium Shot)\\n**Camera Motion:** Pan from left to right\\n**Scene Description:** Both in frame. The man’s finger is almost at the woman's nose; she crosses her arms, unyielding.\\n**Character Action:** Intense confrontation in the center of the square.\\n**Facial Expression:** Man is furious; woman is dismissive.\\n**Product Interaction:** Visual contrast of the two fabrics under the same lighting.\\n**Lighting:** Side lighting to enhance facial contours.\\n**Dialogue:** 男：“你再说一遍？” 女：“事实就是如此。”\\n**Transition:** Cut to next shot\\n\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"fb14bb6626fa0e0b9a3a9e8f174196d4e528dc1c8327b36e43d7342aeedae107.png\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=fb14bb6626fa0e0b9a3a9e8f174196d4e528dc1c8327b36e43d7342aeedae107.png&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJhMjhkMzRkNmE5OGNkYmI4MjVhYmRiMzRhYjhmMzNhMSIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA0MjYyNDE4MTAsInRzIjoxNzc5ODIxNDQxODEwLCJzaWduIjoiM2ZmZjM2MDZkYzhlYTY3ZWU4NDQ3NTkxNmZlMmE2Y2MifQ==&Rh-Identify=a28d34d6a98cdbb825abdb34ab8f33a1\"},{\"id\":\"1779821727349n8qwx\",\"start\":217,\"length\":71,\"prompt\":\"**Shot Type:** Close-up (Breaking the fourth wall)\\n**Camera Motion:** Slow push in\\n**Scene Description:** The man suddenly turns to face the camera directly, hands folded.\\n**Character Action:** Appealing to the audience like a social media influencer.\\n**Facial Expression:** Serious, aggrieved, competitive.\\n**Product Interaction:** Close-up on the high-collar detail of the cheongsam.\\n**Lighting:** Soft facial fill light.\\n**Dialogue:** “姐妹们，我好看还是她好看？评评理！”\\n**Transition:** Quick cut\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"5720d256b4114f572bbf850fee7632a845f5ad0e59647fa17229ab12ec44dd82.png\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=5720d256b4114f572bbf850fee7632a845f5ad0e59647fa17229ab12ec44dd82.png&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJhMjhkMzRkNmE5OGNkYmI4MjVhYmRiMzRhYjhmMzNhMSIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA0MjYyNDE4MTAsInRzIjoxNzc5ODIxNDQxODEwLCJzaWduIjoiM2ZmZjM2MDZkYzhlYTY3ZWU4NDQ3NTkxNmZlMmE2Y2MifQ==&Rh-Identify=a28d34d6a98cdbb825abdb34ab8f33a1\"},{\"id\":\"1779821757720mnlw4\",\"start\":288,\"length\":72,\"prompt\":\"**Shot Type:** Group Shot / Crowd Reaction\\n**Camera Motion:** Handheld shake (Dynamic)\\n**Scene Description:** Young people in the CBD square laugh and point at the man.\\n**Character Action:** Crowd cheers, some give thumbs up.\\n**Facial Expression:** Excited, laughing, ecstatic.\\n**Product Interaction:** Crowd gesturing towards the man's floral cheongsam.\\n**Lighting:** Chaotic and energetic urban party lights.\\n**Dialogue:** 群众（齐声）：“男的穿旗袍好看！！！”\\n**Transition:** Cut to next shot\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"cd673ceba62a90eca8e80456e21ce12fa32b86ab2552bfae1b29c53f9dfa1604.png\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=cd673ceba62a90eca8e80456e21ce12fa32b86ab255