 woman in a dark green patterned cheongsam with braided hair stands in the same CBD background.\n**Character Action:** She stands elegantly but with a defiant gaze.\n**Facial Expression:** Sassy, confident, slightly mocking.\n**Product Interaction:** The cheongsam fits perfectly, showing the sheen of green silk.\n**Lighting:** Neon cool-toned background contrasting her skin tone.\n**Dialogue:** “我穿上比你穿上好看。”\n**Transition:** Cut to next shot | **Shot Type:** Two-shot (Medium Shot)\n**Camera Motion:** Pan from left to right\n**Scene Description:** Both in frame. The man’s finger is almost at the woman's nose; she crosses her arms, unyielding.\n**Character Action:** Intense confrontation in the center of the square.\n**Facial Expression:** Man is furious; woman is dismissive.\n**Product Interaction:** Visual contrast of the two fabrics under the same lighting.\n**Lighting:** Side lighting to enhance facial contours.\n**Dialogue:** 男：“你再说一遍？” 女：“事实就是如此。”\n**Transition:** Cut to next shot\n | **Shot Type:** Close-up (Breaking the fourth wall)\n**Camera Motion:** Slow push in\n**Scene Description:** The man suddenly turns to face the camera directly, hands folded.\n**Character Action:** Appealing to the audience like a social media influencer.\n**Facial Expression:** Serious, aggrieved, competitive.\n**Product Interaction:** Close-up on the high-collar detail of the cheongsam.\n**Lighting:** Soft facial fill light.\n**Dialogue:** “姐妹们，我好看还是她好看？评评理！”\n**Transition:** Quick cut | **Shot Type:** Group Shot / Crowd Reaction\n**Camera Motion:** Handheld shake (Dynamic)\n**Scene Description:** Young people in the CBD square laugh and point at the man.\n**Character Action:** Crowd cheers, some give thumbs up.\n**Facial Expression:** Excited, laughing, ecstatic.\n**Product Interaction:** Crowd gesturing towards the man's floral cheongsam.\n**Lighting:** Chaotic and energetic urban party lights.\n**Dialogue:** 群众（齐声）：“男的穿旗袍好看！！！”\n**Transition:** Cut to next shot", "71,73,73,71,72